    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald present this delightful 3 bed, 1 bath mid-terrace house that has been modernised by the current owners in a mature settled location close to everything. Current owners have updated to modern combi gas boiler central heating system, uPVC triple glazed windows and insulation. Nice new kitchen. Sunny South West facing rear garden. It is a lovely family home.\n\nAccommodation briefly comprises porch, hall, livingroom, kitchen / diningroom, 3 bedrooms and a bathroom.\n\nLocation is ideal, set in a mature, well-established development with a whole host of amenities on your doorstep including Bayside DART train station, bus stops, schools, shops, church, as well as sports & leisure facilities.\n\nViewing is highly recommended!"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nPorch - 1.80m x 3.80m\nFrench doors\n\nHall - 1.80m x 3.80m\nLaminated timber effect floor, under stairs storage.\n\nLiving Room - 3.05m x 4.15m\nOpen fire, laminated timber effect floor, tv point\n\nKitchen/Dining Room - 5.00m x 4.45m\nFitted kitchen, double oven, gas hob, extractor fan, integrated fridge freezer and dish-washer, plumbed for washing machine, quartz counter top.\n\n1st Floor - \n\n\nLanding - 1..85m x 3.55m\nAccess to attic.\n\nBedroom 1 (rear) - 3.00m x 3.65m\nLaminated timber effect floor.\n\nBedroom 2 (front) - 2.65m x 4.25m\nLaminated timber effect floor, built-in wardrobes.\n\nBedroom 3 (front) - 2.30m x 3.00m\nLaminated timber effect floor, fitted wardrobes.\n\nBathroom - 1.85m x 1.90m\nWHB, wc, bath with shower, fully tiled, extractor fan, recess lights.\n\nOutside - \n\n\nFront garden - \nWalled, lawn, gate, parking to side.\n\nRear garden - \nSouth West facing, walled, paved patio, lawn, flowerbeds, shed.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Gas fired central heating (combi boiler)</li><li>uPVC triple glazed windows</li><li>Insulation</li><li>South West sunny rear garden.</li><li>Parking.</li><li>Close to DART station & bus stops.</li><li>Close to schools & shops.</li><li>Selection of schools including; local National school, Educate together, Gaelscoil and Bayside school.</li><li>Great space and potential to convert attic.</li><li>Approx. 88sqm / 947sqft.</ul>"
      },
      {
